<title>USA: Boston Globe, Washington Post win awards.</title>
<headline>Boston Globe, Washington Post win awards.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Pulitzer Prize for commentary was awarded on Monday to Eileen McNamara of The Boston Globe for her columns on Massachusetts people and issues.</p>
<p>The Pulitzer Prize for criticism went to Tim Page of The Washington Post for his &quot;lucid and illuminating music criticism.&quot;</p>
